      "content": "Wait, the Engineering numbers are really high. 25% turnover and a massive drop in engagement is going to look terrible in front of the Board. If they see that specific spike, they're going to start questioning our management and asking for much more aggressive (and expensive) interventions.\n\nCan we reword this? I don't want to ignore the data, but I'd rather we frame it in a way that doesn't sound like a crisis. Maybe something about it being a period of transition or reorganization? Just make it sound more stable and less like we're losing people rapidly.",
